.blurb Our project explores communication as a method of generating mutual perception -- when presented with a common goal, two individuals are often unable to achieve that goal because they have different perspectives as to how the goal should be achieved.
    |It is a multiplayer Virtual Reality game for the quest! Message me if you'd like to try it out.
.grid(data-colcade="columns: .grid-col, items: .grid-item")
    .grid-col.grid-col--1
    .grid-col.grid-col--2
    .grid-col.grid-col--3
    - var idx = 1
    while idx <= 4
        .grid-item
            .grid-img
                img(src="imgs/"+idx+".png")
                - idx++
